{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Sd1ZawgAzb6FxKEjnvc9lg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:24.594945+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Sd1ZawgAzb6FxKEjnvc9lg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/GrFZCwn1HxumJk0BbAMiay6m64uDmpZXYDalyoR8qpmzPwxkQzPcZGZjAWpM4uDyiakwy5YK3cqSwnHaQYtvvOeg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section><section><p><b><span>SHHMU</span></b></p></section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>海南医科大学第二临床医学院</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>优秀大学生夏令营活动的通知</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>海南医科大学第二附属医院</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_gif/GrFZCwn1HxumJk0BbAMiay6m64uDmpZXYn1F5ESox9Vib51cjpLWy96INqFolXgGtk2uiak8BsKheMr7SvH8xURSg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/GrFZCwn1HxumJk0BbAMiay6m64uDmpZXYBia2Bo79K0zNr7oCrruVSlbMDzEBUasauwYfB76hTvmCJDRU8AJ2hpw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>海南医科大学历经78年的发展，已建成</span><span><strong><span>本科－硕士－博士－博士后</span></strong></span><span>贯通的专业人才培养体系。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/GrFZCwn1HxumJk0BbAMiay6m64uDmpZXYVJ7RWjzL8eBpZlpyI4uVuvLicZPWPP7icKBLEC9JwveK5Qm5uCbAGXtw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>海南医科大学第二附属医院/海南医科大学第二临床医学院以</span><span><strong><span>“一部、两所、四院、四中心”</span></strong></span><span>为发展战略，深入推进学科群打造，目前拥有</span><span><strong><span>5个国家级重点专科</span></strong></span><span>（心血管外科、胃肠外科、重症医学科、消化内科、心血管内科），</span><strong><span><span>3个国家级医学分中心</span></span></strong><span>（国家感染性疾病临床研究中心分中心、国家热带病研究中心海南分中心和国家心血管疾病临床医学研究中心分中心），</span><span><strong><span>10个省级重点学科</span></strong></span><span>（感染性疾病科、器官移植科、消化内科、普通外科、肝胆外科、心血管内科、心脏大血管外科、热带病科、重症医学科和麻醉科），</span><span><strong><span>2个省级医学中心</span></strong></span><span>（海南省危重孕产妇救治中心、海南省危重新生儿救治中心），</span><span><strong><span>3个省级临床医学研究中心</span></strong></span><span>（海南省急危重症临床医学研究中心、海南省热带疾病临床医学研究中心、海南省泌尿系统疾病临床医学研究中心），</span><span><strong><span>1个国家卫健委重点实验室</span></strong></span><span>（国家卫生健康委员会热带病防治重点实验室），</span><span><strong><span>2个研究所</span></strong></span><span>（移植医学研究所、肾脏病研究所），</span><span><strong><span>2个院士创新平台</span></strong></span><span>（于金明院士团队创新中心、樊代明院士团队创新中心），</span><span><strong><span>1个院士工作站</span></strong></span><span>（马骏院士工作站）。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/GrFZCwn1HxumJk0BbAMiay6m64uDmpZXYCk5pxBOia1tzcdhWGfibicLIAAMz526oicbZDomsCKK9ibpsJHceibIziaEsw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>医院医疗特色鲜明，五大实体器官移植及其联合移植、心脏大血管疾病综合救治、急危重症抢救、神经系统疾病综合治疗、肿瘤高端诊断与治疗、热带病与耐多药结核病诊断与治疗、外科快速康复治疗以及突发公共卫生事件处置能力等方面均已达到海南省内领先、国内先进水平。医院承担海南医科大学本科生、硕士研究生、博士研究生、留学生等各个层次人才培养工作,临床医学为ESI全球排名前1%的学科。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/GrFZCwn1HxumJk0BbAMiay6m64uDmpZXYWzicS85qHn618LVSdftF373bAoCBxGOE3AYVtCWkkKf8WOq4V9PsX3g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>导师介绍</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_gif/GrFZCwn1HxumJk0BbAMiay6m64uDmpZXYIJLH0UXCayOzdvKicIT9adrrfyo4udslqESA6rUaMQSsWyh4w4Lj53Q/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>单位导师简介详见网站</span></strong></p><p><span>http://shhmu.net/cn/yjsdsxq</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/GrFZCwn1HxumJk0BbAMiay6m64uDmpZXYWzicS85qHn618LVSdftF373bAoCBxGOE3AYVtCWkkKf8WOq4V9PsX3g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_gif/GrFZCwn1HxumJk0BbAMiay6m64uDmpZXYIJLH0UXCayOzdvKicIT9adrrfyo4udslqESA6rUaMQSsWyh4w4Lj53Q/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）基本条件</span></p><p><span>1.中华人民共和国公民。</span></p><p><span>2.拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></p><p><span>3.身体健康状况符合国家和学校规定的体检要求。</span></p><p><span>4.2026届应届本科生(临床医学及相关专业)，须满足以下任一:</span></p><p><span>(1)达到本科院校推免资格基本条件;</span></p><p><span>(2)本科前三年成绩排名前30%(“双一流”高校可放宽至前40%);</span></p><p><span>5.英语水平(满足其一)</span></p><p><span>（1）CET-4&gt;480分;(2)托福&gt;85/雅思 &gt;6.0;(3)其他等效英语成绩(如专业英语四级等)。</span></p><p><span>6.热爱临床医学研究，具备创新潜力和科研志向。</span></p><p><span>(二)优先条件</span></p><p><span>1.CET-6&gt;450分;</span></p><p><span>2.以第一作者发表论文、获省级以上竞赛奖或专利;</span></p><p><span>3.参与省级科研项目或获国家级奖学金</span></p><p><span>4.达到本科院校的推免资格基本条件或学习成绩优秀的2026年应届本科生。</span></p><p><span>5.具有浓厚的学术研究兴趣，有较强的创新意识，有志于追求科学研究工作。</span></p><p><span>（三）报名要求</span></p><p><span>点击文末</span><span><strong><span>阅读全文后附件1</span></strong></span><span>查看</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/GrFZCwn1HxumJk0BbAMiay6m64uDmpZXYWzicS85qHn618LVSdftF373bAoCBxGOE3AYVtCWkkKf8WOq4V9PsX3g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请方法</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_gif/GrFZCwn1HxumJk0BbAMiay6m64uDmpZXYIJLH0UXCayOzdvKicIT9adrrfyo4udslqESA6rUaMQSsWyh4w4Lj53Q/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）报名方式</span></p><p><span>截止时间:2025年8月25日24:00;</span></p><p><span>提交渠道:</span></p><p><span>1.填写电子版报名申请表（</span><span><strong><span>点击文末阅读全文附件2</span></strong></span><span>）;</span></p><p><span>(主题注明“夏令营报名+姓名+高校”)。</span></p><p><span>2.邮件发送至:262171861@qq.com</span></p><p><span>（二）报名需提交的附件</span></p><p><span>1. 身份证；</span></p><p><span>2. 学生证首页及注册页； </span></p><p><span>3. 学习成绩单及成绩排名证明（由本科期间所在学校或院系教务部门加盖公章）；</span></p><p><span>4. 体现自身英语水平的证明(国家英语四级或六级考试成绩单，或其他英语水平证明材料)；</span></p><p><span>5.其他材料：获得的奖励证明；公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的工作成果等有参考价值的证明材料。</span></p><p><span>申请人将以上材料按照1-5项顺序整理成一个PDF文件，命名为“报名（学科）专业代码+姓名+高校名+手机号”并以附件的形式随报名邮件一起发送至邮箱。（注:代码参考附件目录）</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/GrFZCwn1HxumJk0BbAMiay6m64uDmpZXYWzicS85qHn618LVSdftF373bAoCBxGOE3AYVtCWkkKf8WOq4V9PsX3g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>入营通知方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_gif/GrFZCwn1HxumJk0BbAMiay6m64uDmpZXYIJLH0UXCayOzdvKicIT9adrrfyo4udslqESA6rUaMQSsWyh4w4Lj53Q/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2025年8月29日前，以邮件通知所有申请人审核结果;获得入营资格者将同步收到《入营须知》《日程安排》及《注意事项》。</span></p><p><span>特别提示:未按时报到者视为自动放弃资格。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/GrFZCwn1HxumJk0BbAMiay6m64uDmpZXYWzicS85qHn618LVSdftF373bAoCBxGOE3AYVtCWkkKf8WOq4V9PsX3g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>优秀营员评选</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_gif/GrFZCwn1HxumJk0BbAMiay6m64uDmpZXYIJLH0UXCayOzdvKicIT9adrrfyo4udslqESA6rUaMQSsWyh4w4Lj53Q/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.根据夏令营期间综合表现(含面试考核、实践参与度等)评选“优秀营员”。</span></p><p><span>2.获得本科院校推免资格的优秀营员，报考我校2026年推荐面试攻读硕士研究生可直接被录取，入学后可优先申请硕博连读研究生。</span></p><p><span>3.未在本科院校获得推免资格的优秀营员，报考海南医科大学并达到我校2026年全日制硕士研究生复试基本分数线即可被优先录取。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/GrFZCwn1HxumJk0BbAMiay6m64uDmpZXYWzicS85qHn618LVSdftF373bAoCBxGOE3AYVtCWkkKf8WOq4V9PsX3g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>具体活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_gif/GrFZCwn1HxumJk0BbAMiay6m64uDmpZXYIJLH0UXCayOzdvKicIT9adrrfyo4udslqESA6rUaMQSsWyh4w4Lj53Q/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）活动时间及方式</span></p><p><span>2025年9月3至5日，线下方式开展活动。</span></p><p><span>地点:海南医科大学第二附属医院</span></p><p><span>（二）活动主要内容</span></p><p><span>9月3日:</span></p><p><span>15:00-17:00 营员报到(医院行政楼4楼教务科4办公室)</span></p><p><span>9月4日:</span></p><p><span>9:00 举办开营仪式，平台介绍、课题组介绍；医院及实验室参观等</span></p><p><span>9月5日:</span></p><p><span>9:00 师生交流面试考核、结营仪式暨优秀营员表彰;</span></p><p><span>16:00 闭幕、离营.</span></p><p><span>注:日程以实际安排为准</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></span></p><p><span>1.请认真填写各项信息，并保证所填数据真实可靠，如因材料虚假或其他不端行为导致的一切后果，由申请者承担。</span></p><p><span>2.报名时手机号码和电子邮箱务必填写准确，以免影响通知正常接收。</span></p><p><span>3.入营通知将以邮件形式发送，请注意查收。</span></p><p><span>4.入选同学须在报到时提交报名申请表、所有附件材料原件及复印件以备查验。</span></p><p><span>5.我单位将提供营员在夏令营期间的餐食和住宿费用，往返路费由学生个人自理。</span></p><p><span>6.面试由营员进行简要汇报，主要内容为自我简介，包含获奖情况、科研经历和学业成绩等。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></span></p><p><span>联系人：潘老师，089866808081</span></p><p><span>邮  箱：262171861@qq.com</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span>—— 点击文末阅读全文 ——</span></strong></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/GrFZCwn1HxumJk0BbAMiay6m64uDmpZXYY8ceVVVY3838ibO8Oic59ddcVoE5lDKPPbwLNXHiaZ4icvxBTwyq0xU1kQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/GrFZCwn1HxumJk0BbAMiay6m64uDmpZXY4cS3picaHzhvic9wVQzf5CqicXQ0230QKyGiaoWsbOdQcdLw88PapqKibPA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>扫描二维码关注我们~</span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>医院地址 |</span></strong></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>1.海南省海口市龙华区椰海大道368号</span></p><p><span>（总院）</span></p><p><span>2.海南省海口市美兰区海府路10号</span></p><p><span>（东湖分院）</span></p><p><span><strong><span>客服中心电话 |</span></strong></span><span> 0898-66809130、13322033767</span></p><p><strong><span><span>投诉电话 | </span></span></strong><span>0898-66808238</span></p><p><span><strong><span>联系电话 | </span></strong></span><span>0898-65392299</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"18760c04d19f6746ebff11014250a7ebadbec640efc6fbf499fb21b2e6f47b38","textLength":2355,"sourceSha256":"eea9f42cd1f8335a73b9967bc445a7f3d6835429f4f2759c160ab6282be5c547","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-6a615589e6c2f3197b05","title":"2025年海南医科大学第二临床医学院优秀大学生夏令营活动的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:24.594945+00:00"}
